{"id":"61f5856a7806f879","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-no-cloning.md","title":"No-Cloning Theorem","display":"thm-no-cloning — No-Cloning Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-no-cloning","aliases":["28-thm-no-cloning","No-Cloning Theorem"],"display":"thm-no-cloning — No-Cloning Theorem","depends_on":["[[28-df-qubit]]","[[28-df-quantum-gate]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.3.4; chapter notes; local inner-product proof","source_printed_pages":"211,232","source_pdf_pages":"237,258","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-no-cloning"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-no-cloning</span><span>No-Cloning Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-no-cloning — No-Cloning Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f087819d10a14c0\" href=\"?note=1f087819d10a14c0\" title=\"28-df-qubit\">28-df-qubit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dec9a25527c3b8b7\" href=\"?note=dec9a25527c3b8b7\" title=\"28-df-quantum-gate\">28-df-quantum-gate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.3.4; chapter notes; local inner-product proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"211,232"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"237,258"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi,\\phi\\in\\mathbf U_1\">\\(\\psi,\\phi\\in\\mathbf U_1\\)</span> 为归一化代表向量，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f087819d10a14c0\" href=\"?note=1f087819d10a14c0\" title=\"28-df-qubit\">28-df-qubit</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;|\\langle\\psi,\\phi\\rangle|&lt;1\">\\(0&lt;|\\langle\\psi,\\phi\\rangle|&lt;1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{QGate}_2\">\\(\\mathbf{QGate}_2\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dec9a25527c3b8b7\" href=\"?note=dec9a25527c3b8b7\" title=\"28-df-quantum-gate\">28-df-quantum-gate</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|0\\rangle\">\\(|0\\rangle\\)</span> 为辅助空白态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists U\\in\\mathbf{QGate}_2\\ \\exists\\theta,\\eta\\in\\mathbb R\\ [U(\\psi\\otimes|0\\rangle)=e^{i\\theta}\\psi\\otimes\\psi\\land U(\\phi\\otimes|0\\rangle)=e^{i\\eta}\\phi\\otimes\\phi].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists U\\in\\mathbf{QGate}_2\\ \\exists\\theta,\\eta\\in\\mathbb R\\ [U(\\psi\\otimes|0\\rangle)=e^{i\\theta}\\psi\\otimes\\psi\\land U(\\phi\\otimes|0\\rangle)=e^{i\\eta}\\phi\\otimes\\phi].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>取两式内积的绝对值得 r=r²，其中 0&lt;r&lt;1，矛盾。这样结论对输出的任意全局相位都成立，也直接排除通用幺正克隆器。公式使用向量集 U1，避免将相位等价类当作向量。书中 no-cloning 为讨论性引用；本条完整本地证明独立给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§10.3.4; chapter notes; local inner-product proof，印刷页 211,232；PDF 页 237,258。原书未定位到本条的完整直接陈述；这是与书中主题相关的本地补充。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-qubit","status":"resolved","id":"1f087819d10a14c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-qubit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-gate","status":"resolved","id":"dec9a25527c3b8b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-quantum-gate]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-qubit","status":"resolved","id":"1f087819d10a14c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\psi,\\phi\\in\\mathbf U_1$ 为归一化代表向量，见 [[28-df-qubit]]；$0<|\\langle\\psi,\\phi\\rangle|<1$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-gate","status":"resolved","id":"dec9a25527c3b8b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{QGate}_2$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-gate]]，$|0\\rangle$ 为辅助空白态。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\psi,\\phi\\in\\mathbf U_1","display":false},{"tex":"0<|\\langle\\psi,\\phi\\rangle|<1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{QGate}_2","display":false},{"tex":"|0\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists U\\in\\mathbf{QGate}_2\\ \\exists\\theta,\\eta\\in\\mathbb R\\ [U(\\psi\\otimes|0\\rangle)=e^{i\\theta}\\psi\\otimes\\psi\\land U(\\phi\\otimes|0\\rangle)=e^{i\\eta}\\phi\\otimes\\phi].","display":true}],"bytes":1572,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"基本结论：[[28-thm-no-cloning]]、[[28-thm-factoring-in-bqp]]。"}],"outgoing":["1f087819d10a14c0","dec9a25527c3b8b7"]}